"verdant75" <verdant75@hotmail.com> wrote:
>I've been doing the polytrap trick with pets and I discovered something
>odd.  Master-liches and arch-liches either evade the trap 100% of the
>time or they are immune to polymorph.  Anyone else notice this?

Monsters never evade polymorph traps, AFAICT from examining src/trap.c ;
however, monsters receive a saving throw against polymorph effects.

Master liches and arch-liches have a base saving throw of 90%. Polymorph
traps have an effective level of 12 for purposes of monster saving
throws, giving master liches (17 HD base) a 95% or better saving throw
them and arch-liches (25 HD base) a 103% or better saving throw.
